//            its text is still replaced by the name, but it gets no
//            declaration of its own -- the reused name's already has one.
// fixe_ru: fixe_ru holds one entry per event, so its length is what a function that
// resets or pushes an event column changes. fix_ev_reset5 ends the reset
// chain -- it calls nothing, so a `calls` clause cannot reach it and only a
// reader of one of its own columns can.
