// How many events have been marked for a declaration of their own, and how
// many have been named. A `then` check takes no parameters, so a function
// whose whole effect is a push or an lset on one of these columns can only be
// observed through a reader of it -- fix_sep_at and fix_mark_sep
// (../../../decide/touch/sep.id) are what this one is for.
